description: Keep persistence and financial orchestration replaceable for CRM scaling
globs: "{services/**/*.ts,lib/storage.ts,components/finance/finance-provider.tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Data access layer

- UI components never import `lib/storage.ts` directly. Use a service interface from `services/`.
- `services/projects.ts` owns the active project repository. A future Supabase adapter must implement the same interface.
- Keep storage keys and legacy fields stable. Schema evolution is additive; new entity fields are optional.
- Financial orchestration belongs in `services/financials.ts`; money math remains in `lib/tax-calculator.ts`.
- Do not mix browser APIs into repository interfaces.

```ts
// Bad: component coupled to IndexedDB
const projects = await get("freelance-flow/transactions");

// Good: replaceable repository boundary
const snapshot = await browserProjectsRepository.load();
```

